  <h1>Alarm Tool: Create and Record Your Own Alarm Sound with Oscillators</h1>

  <div class="blog-meta">
    <span class="blog-meta-badge">How-to</span>
    <span>September 17, 2026</span>
    <span>· 5 min read</span>
  </div>

  <p>
    The default alarm sounds like everyone else's, the notification in your app is too quiet or too shrill, and your presentation is missing a clear signal tone. The KodiniTools Alarm Tool solves this in the browser: build alarm and signal tones from up to 12 oscillators, hear the result instantly, save it as a preset and record it as an audio file. No installation, no registration.
  </p>

